cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this software in research, please cite it using the metadata
  in this file. If you reuse or substantially adapt this project's code,
  including through AI-assisted rewriting or translation, please link to
  https://github.com/ftxi/5dchess_engine in your project's README or 
  acknowledgments.
title: "5D Chess Engine"
authors:
  - family-names: "ftxi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ftxi/5dchess_engine"
url: "https://ftxi.github.io/5dchess_engine/"
license: BSD-2-Clause
abstract: >-
  A C++ engine and game logic library for 5D Chess With Multiverse
  Time Travel, with Monte Carlo tree search, legal action generation,
  checkmate detection, a web analyzer, and Python and JavaScript bindings.
keywords:
  - "5D Chess With Multiverse Time Travel"
  - "5D chess"
  - "chess engine"
  - "Monte Carlo tree search"
  - "split moves"
  - "legal action generation"
  - "game analysis"
